     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#000000\">Good day,</font><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">I would like to ask you if the <span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\">Complex Region </span><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\">Spatial</span><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\"> Smoother (</span><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\">CReSS</span><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\">) </span><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\">method can be implemented with INLA?</span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\"><font color=\"#000000\">Thank you in advance.</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\"><font color=\"#000000\">Best regards,</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:18.2000007629395px\"><font color=\"#000000\">Henry</font></span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "vuagEOraeuIJ",
